    - target: {fileID: 5905881967701677635, guid: 3938ed1ae5c23814f8817ead1ed0d3bf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'This scene uses a common behavior tree design pattern. This scene demonstrates
        using an alternating Selector/Sequence structure making it easy to add or
        remove behavior without needing to restructure the behavior tree.

        The
        behavior tree agents also use a Subtree reference assigned on the BehaviorTree
        component which allows the use of the same tree for both agents.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
